{"id":60502,"date":"2026-08-19T10:20:13","date_gmt":"2026-08-19T09:20:13","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=60502"},"modified":"2026-09-03T01:42:51","modified_gmt":"2026-09-03T00:42:51","slug":"trilhos-dos-calceteiros","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/trilhos-dos-calceteiros\/","title":{"rendered":"Trilhos dos Calceteiros 2027"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Trilhos dos Calceteiros 2027<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Os <strong>Trilhos dos Calceteiros 2027<\/strong> realizam-se no domingo, <strong>14 de Mar\u00e7o de 2027<\/strong>, na hist\u00f3rica vila de <strong>Fanh\u00f5es<\/strong> \u2014 a Capital do Calceteiro \u2014, no concelho de <strong>Loures<\/strong>, distrito de <strong>Lisboa<\/strong>. Promovida pela <strong>Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Faz-te aos Trilhos!<\/strong> com o forte apoio da <strong>Junta de Freguesia de Fanh\u00f5es<\/strong> e da <strong>C\u00e2mara Municipal de Loures<\/strong>, a prova homenageia a nobre arte e mem\u00f3ria dos mestres calceteiros portugueses.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Com concentra\u00e7\u00e3o e partidas nas imedia\u00e7\u00f5es dos Bombeiros Volunt\u00e1rios de Fanh\u00f5es, o <strong>Trail Longo (31 km \/ 1300m D+)<\/strong> arranca \u00e0s <strong>09h00<\/strong>, o <strong>Trail Curto (17 km \/ 700m D+)<\/strong> \u00e0s <strong>09h30<\/strong>, o <strong>Trail Experience (10 km \/ 400m D+)<\/strong> \u00e0s <strong>09h50<\/strong> e a <strong>Caminhada (10 km)<\/strong> \u00e0s <strong>10h00<\/strong>. Os percursos exploram cen\u00e1rios deslumbrantes por Fanh\u00f5es, S\u00e3o Juli\u00e3o do Tojal, Bucelas e Lousa, passando pelo Forte do Mosqueiro e de Ribas, culminando com medalha comemorativa, t-shirt t\u00e9cnica e o afamado almo\u00e7o de feijoada de javali.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data &#038; Hor\u00e1rio<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-