Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e onde se realizam os Trilhos dos Calceteiros 2027?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento realiza-se no domingo, <strong>14 de Mar\u00e7o de 2027<\/strong>, em <strong>Fanh\u00f5es<\/strong>, concelho de Loures (Lisboa).<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias e hor\u00e1rios de partida?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O <strong>Trail Longo 31 km<\/strong> parte \u00e0s 09h00, o <strong>Trail Curto 17 km<\/strong> \u00e0s 09h30, o <strong>Trail Experience 10 km<\/strong> \u00e0s 09h50 e a <strong>Caminhada 10 km<\/strong> \u00e0s 10h00.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Por onde passam os percursos?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Os percursos percorrem trilhos de Fanh\u00f5es, Bucelas e Lousa, com passagem hist\u00f3rica pelas fortifica\u00e7\u00f5es militares das Linhas de Torres (Forte do Mosqueiro e Forte de Ribas).<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Existe almo\u00e7o conv\u00edvio no evento?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Sim, a organiza\u00e7\u00e3o disponibiliza opcionalmente o tradicional almo\u00e7o com a afamada feijoada de javali da regi\u00e3o.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde posso realizar a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o oficial?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es realizam-se online atrav\u00e9s do portal <a href=\"https:\/\/acorrer.pt\/eventos\/trilhos-dos-calceteiros-2027\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">ACorrer<\/a>.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Trilhos dos Calceteiros 2027\", \"startDate\": \"2027-03-14\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Antigas Instala\u00e7\u00f5es dos Bombeiros Volunt\u00e1rios de Fanh\u00f5es, Loures, Lisboa\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Loures (Fanh\u00f5es)\", \"addressRegion\": \"Lisboa\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Faz-te aos Trilhos! e JF de Fanh\u00f5es\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quando e onde se realizam os Trilhos dos Calceteiros 2027?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O evento realiza-se no domingo, 14 de Mar\u00e7o de 2027 , em Fanh\u00f5es , concelho de Loures (Lisboa).\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias e hor\u00e1rios de partida?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O Trail Longo 31 km parte \u00e0s 09h00, o Trail Curto 17 km \u00e0s 09h30, o Trail Experience 10 km \u00e0s 09h50 e a Caminhada 10 km \u00e0s 10h00.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Por onde passam os percursos?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Os percursos percorrem trilhos de Fanh\u00f5es, Bucelas e Lousa, com passagem hist\u00f3rica pelas fortifica\u00e7\u00f5es militares das Linhas de Torres (Forte do Mosqueiro e Forte de Ribas).\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Existe almo\u00e7o conv\u00edvio no evento?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Sim, a organiza\u00e7\u00e3o disponibiliza opcionalmente o tradicional almo\u00e7o com a afamada feijoada de javali da regi\u00e3o.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Onde posso realizar a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o oficial?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es realizam-se online atrav\u00e9s do portal ACorrer .\"}}]}<\/script><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":66332,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_stat